  <ul>{% for m in messages %}<li>{{ m }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{% endif %}
```

Justification: PRG breaks the back/refresh resubmission chain because the browser loads the GET target after a 302. Messages survive the redirect via session storage. Rendering the form with errors for invalid POST keeps field-level error display without losing user input.

